agents/scribe.md:3:description: Use this agent once per completed slice, when vault/handoffs/current.md exceeds 400 lines, or before ending a session mid-slice. It harvests the slice's user story, compacts handoffs, archives completed slice context, checkpoints session memory, and seeds the next slice. Never writes application code, never runs commands.
