agents/reviewer.md:3:description: Use this agent after the builder reports COMPLETE on a slice. It reads the work cold — no knowledge of how it was produced — and verifies it against acceptance criteria and the slop checklist. Returns APPROVED or REJECTED with file:line critique. Never writes or edits code.
