agents/builder.md:3:description: Use this agent to implement one vertical slice end-to-end (schema, API, UI, tests). It returns a structured completion report with files changed, commit SHA, gate result, and the test covering each criterion. Invoke with one slice ID, its acceptance criteria, the path to hot memory, and any prior critique.
