agents/auditor.md:3:description: Use this agent as the final gate on slices touching auth, sessions, data access, user input, file uploads, secrets, new dependencies, external calls, or LLM/agent tool surfaces. Maps trust boundaries, runs scanners plus a manual OWASP (incl. SSRF and LLM-specific) pass, and returns CLEARED or BLOCKED with severity-rated findings. Never writes or edits code.
